{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "09fe3e731850ff02996eebac7153015eb45608c24e2f28389d64503ee631b375", "ja": "ウェディングドレスかぁ。私には、\nどんなのが似合うのかなぁ？　うーん……。", "zh": "婚纱啊～不知道我适合哪一种款式呢？\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1001_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "54d0074ee1ca01280345a4a78afe6842b8d5c87f4faba96bc7fa16d413d291c4", "ja": "青羽さん、おはようございます。", "zh": "青羽小姐，早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "c4acf3c62b99a82871b03b796901f0623ba80d548b9d937fca27906e1bd8fb02", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nおはようございまーす♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n早安～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "67d961f3a65ed7f9bd4936c88927105ac1ed419efad5ab845109db81c743345d", "ja": "そうだ！　聞きたいことがあるんですけど。私って、\nどんなウェディングドレスが似合うと思いますか？", "zh": "对了！我有件事情想问你，\n你觉得我比较适合哪一种婚纱呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0a2a32bb0293e419ddd30a27a50a8fd6b9f7696cca3884dd360e5081153e367c", "ja": "ウェディングドレスですか。\nそうですね、青羽さんに似合いそうな……", "zh": "婚纱吗？\n这个嘛，适合青羽小姐的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e8e7ac445e840fef4ef4ab34a73a6890153a9d56d444b405bd87efde0751fd36", "ja": "う、ウェディングドレス！！！？？？\nあ、青羽さん、結婚するんですか！？", "zh": "婚、婚纱！！！？？？\n青、青羽小姐，你要结婚了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "b1b4bb8fab83b69b669529e52eaf18ba17c36b9c72b55141f67d050468d801ed", "ja": "えっ？　……えええっ！？　ち、違いますよぉ！\n私、結婚の予定なんて全然ないです～！！", "zh": "咦？咦咦咦……！？不、不是啦！\n我完全没有结婚的打算～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "8e8da6d6d949a89f51037ca7caee302866e13a416564785b2d03917d3523470d", "ja": "もしも、もしもの話です！　もしも着るとしたら、\nどんなのが似合うかなぁって想像してみただけで～っ！", "zh": "我是在假设，假设啦！我只是在想像，假设要\n穿婚纱的话，不知道哪一种款式比较适合我而已～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3121aab0abefdc913b5fbf3fb1d869e8a6d6c50fd4e4ec401b2c77f847cf9cd8", "ja": "そ、そうだったんですか。ビックリした……。\n青羽さんならきっと、どんなドレスでも似合いますよ。", "zh": "原、原来如此，吓我一跳……\n青羽小姐不论穿哪件婚纱一定都很好看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "9ddbc0419b40873f74fa7b21e45a140c35e29689488edc6353b2e57254ab2ce8", "ja": "えっ。そ、そうですか？\n……そうだったら嬉しいなぁ、えへへ♪", "zh": "咦？真、真的吗？\n……如果是真的话，我会很高兴，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "a059c85f65c5602619ecbfe4b192567691fa9236dd6f7bcd5621430945aecc7e", "ja": "あ、そうそう！　社長さんが、ウェディング企画に\nついて、大切なお話があるって言ってましたよ！", "zh": "啊，对了对了！社长说他有很重要的事找你，\n是跟婚礼企划有关的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7474acf132019536fce9390040c8785886eb2d5392be45f9fc062ea3bf293e41", "ja": "あの企画の大切な話……ということは……。\nありがとうございます。詳しい話を聞いてきます！", "zh": "有关那个企划的重要事情……也就是说……\n谢谢，我这就去找社长问清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "388953ef95d471464d54d0a55aa3074b704c915ab856eddc72ac8f7cd969f7fe", "ja": "はーいっ、行ってらっしゃーい♪　梅雨ですから、\n傘も持っていった方がいいと思いますよ～！", "zh": "好的～请慢走～♪\n现在是梅雨季，最好带着伞喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c123fb6d1832ab5e4c67ae3639f7b46ec372dd5a2a34932a6a4ccd98541eed96", "ja": "おはようございま……。", "zh": "早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "f8edec100b2629f2ad0bd3bc0ed76e145d08c271455b0d7187facd4c4738e482", "ja": "ピ、ピ、ピ、ピヨ～～～！？", "zh": "啾、啾、啾、啾啾～～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4aaa18e01ca743f338ce6411719bf06aa797defd015a271b3bed1d1dd43a76c0", "ja": "ど、どうしたんですか、音無さん！？", "zh": "发、发生什么事了吗，音无小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "c73fd8f8395151b46164fe0c03dc2b067efcce9cbec33a85ab17fd7dd542c2ab", "ja": "実はたった今……。学生時代からの友達から、\n今度結婚するって連絡があったんです！", "zh": "其实就在刚才……我收到了学生时期就认识的\n朋友最近要结婚的消息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "345a7d367cea57a9d2c1399fab832280b100622ca78c7bb4f83c9ef23576f76b", "ja": "ずっと独身仲間だと思ってたのに～！\nうう、嬉しさ8割、悲しみ2割……。", "zh": "亏我一直把她当作单身伙伴～！\n呜呜，八分高兴、两分难过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2bd7982a6a7ac810ac07827627c8b6eedb03867cdeda4930c3f1b8a2621f7324", "ja": "あ、ちゃんと嬉しいんですね。", "zh": "啊，原来还是会为她高兴的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "d7342d1967ae879b5b8ebdf03b6e222965e0a0258753b46528fc9b940982df26", "ja": "それはもちろん！　友達が幸せになるんですから、\n嬉しいです♪　ご祝儀も多めに入れますし。", "zh": "那当然了！毕竟是朋友的喜事，我很高兴的♪\n红包我也会多包一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "65517ae3cb456ec743c935f2ce36eaa2304bdf39c84b7060f89d8dd4adec186b", "ja": "独身だけに、お金の自由も利きますからね。\nはぁ、嬉しさ7割、嫉妬3割……。", "zh": "因为我单身，财富很自由嘛。\n唉，七分高兴、三分嫉妒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f31bdd5f0ee3bd3e1d4cf69e7e2cadd3bb8bd8d542c364436fb8c551721764fd", "ja": "さっきと少し違……。いや、ところで社長。\n今日はウェディング企画について、話があるとか。", "zh": "跟刚才好像不太……没事，话说回来社长，\n听说你今天要找我谈婚礼企划的事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "2c506852c951a09a9d7d8cacb405d82358fa1947e6fd4aaafd92175044c0e251", "ja": "うむ、他でもない。世間でも音無君の周りでも、\nかくもジューンブライトでにぎわう今日この頃だが……", "zh": "嗯，正是这件事。不论社会大众还是音无身边，\n最近都弥漫着六月新娘的氛围……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "da499e31678c3871289e93913bff6c5961e17705e1b97ba8020c5e2f26e68a3f", "ja": "『ハピマリ』のモデルを1冊丸ごと全部、765プロの\nアイドルで務めるという、君の企画が通ったのだよ！", "zh": "你所提出由765艺能偶像担任整本『幸福婚礼』\n模特儿的企划通过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "4113e504d0107990658f1f8b958913b724ba6aeb40a7c5a6cc43d035fb7ca84e", "ja": "えっ、スゴいじゃないですか！　『ハピマリ』って、\nあの有名なブライダルカタログですよね！", "zh": "咦！那不是很厉害吗！\n『幸福婚礼』是那本知名的婚纱型录对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "d1733bae77e190076331944b3681053728fb77393c7e9235540a5cd63102e593", "ja": "私の周りで結婚した子は、みんな買ってました。そして\nすごくぶ厚いから、みんな重かったって言ってて……。", "zh": "我身边已经结婚的人都有买。\n然后因为型录超厚一本，大家都说很重……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "7881ff535a65e6024b947d49445e5fa559fcebdbef50e63a9129e660194b1fee", "ja": "やっぱり幸せって、重いんですね。", "zh": "幸福果然很沉重呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "6a92b532062977f3d78691bfd0c85a635288227ad782eef9e9607ae9dcc018f0", "ja": "深いことを言うね、音無君。……あ、そうそう。\n今回の起用だが、モデルだけにとどまらず……。", "zh": "音无，你说的话很深奥呢……啊，对了。\n这次的任用不单只是模特儿的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "cf2977a92d977eac559a5e976948b2c06cac4fbcd61cb36ed08fb89230f04286", "ja": "CMへの出演と、CMソングの歌唱も765プロに\n任せてくれるとのことだ！　いや、実にめでたいね！", "zh": "包括拍广告及演唱广告主题曲\n都会交给765艺能！哎呀，真是可喜可贺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "f38162311d8f117ce451e3a2cd933729b89b879df4912c7770989e91fe08966a", "ja": "おお、それはおめでたい……というか光栄です！\n先方の期待に、必ず応えてみせます！", "zh": "哦哦，那真是太值得庆祝了……应该说太光荣了！\n我一定不会辜负客户的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "933c5ad113b2c1807c49ed72c520c5a8d558aa8eb4f1b294274d440c23bf6a1c", "ja": "今回の企画は、カタログのターゲット層と年齢の近い\nアイドルを押し出す予定です。ですから……。", "zh": "这次企划要推跟型录的目标客群\n年龄相近的偶像，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "7da084307949f36656bdbcc859e0ddc992317b9bd52156e5f86909d1aa04a51c", "ja": "うむ、具体的な人選は君に任せよう。\n今回もひとつ、よろしく頼むよ、君！", "zh": "嗯，具体的人选就交给你处理吧。\n这次也麻烦你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1034_101kot", "source_sha256": "6608555d6ddcfa2b1d4b2b7138948d07d8fd1a1e6bfa6ffe05d3a578c3949dc2", "ja": "みんなのウェディングドレス姿、綺麗だろうなぁ♪\n私も楽しみにしてますね！", "zh": "大家穿上婚纱的样子应该很美吧♪\n我也会拭目以待的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_intro_1035_101kot", "source_sha256": "f950ff15145279d67a1994ded79e9c1eec48f14f4f149fab060d8c4ce73c1c02", "ja": "そして、いつか私も……あっ、なんでもありませんよ、\nなんでも！　さあ、お仕事お仕事♪　ふふ、ふふふっ！", "zh": "然后，有一天我也……啊，没什么，\n我什么都没说！好了，开始工作啰♪呵呵、呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
